        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001933</IRI>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/obi.owl</IRI>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <IRI>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001933</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Damion Dooley&apos;s note: 
Often a value specification may need to allow for a &quot;data item state&quot; that indicates that a given datum doesn&apos;t have a recorded or observed or retrievable value, and the general reason for this state.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
